<title>USA: Winstar Q3 shr loss widens.</title>
<headline>Winstar Q3 shr loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>WinStar Communications Inc. and Subsidiaries</p>
<p>						Three months</p>
<p>					   1996			1995</p>
<p>Net sales			   $17,297,046	     $8,185,150</p>
<p>Operating loss		    (13,985,018)	   (2,702,302)</p>
<p>Other expense (income)</p>
<p> Interest expense		   9,373,652		  439,338</p>
<p> Interest income		   (2,516,547)	     (198,099)</p>
<p> Amortization of intangibles	295,625		  221,181</p>
<p> Equity in loss of AGT		     --		  120,557</p>
<p>Net loss before income taxes  (21,137,748)	   (3,285,279)</p>
<p>Net loss			    (21,212,375)	   (3,285,279)</p>
<p>Net loss per share			(0.75)		  (0.14)</p>
<p>Avg shares			   28,133,129	     23,042,007</p>
<p>						 NINE MONTHS</p>
<p>Net sales			   $47,980,633	    $20,624,996</p>
<p>Operating loss		   (29,789,375)	    (6,422,560)</p>
<p>Other expense (income)</p>
<p> Interest expense		  27,388,356		  869,266</p>
<p> Interest income		  (8,174,077)		(492,210)</p>
<p> Amortization of intangibles	762,193		  370,086</p>
<p> Equity in loss of AGT		     --		1,224,309</p>
<p>Net loss before inc taxes    (49,765,847)	    (8,394,011)</p>
<p>Net loss			   (50,027,361)	    (8,394,011)</p>
<p>Net loss per share		     (1.81)		   (0.40)</p>
<p>Avg shares			  27,691,452	     21,222,182</p>
<p>NOTE: Winstar said the increased operating loss mostly reflected the rollout of the company's local wireless communications business.</p>
